Hi Kiezzer,
Welcome to the Wallace species distribution modeling community!

This issue is happening because the Environmental Space component (Env Space) is analyses run between two species to characterize the e-space, so you'll need at least two species loaded into Wallace from the Occ Data component, and two selected in the Species Menu.

If you are a first time user, I'd recommend taking a look at our vignette, which has step by step instructions with visuals for each step. It has a section on using the Env Space component, as well as helpful tips (like how to use the Trashcan button to delete unnecessary polygons from the map). Here is the link: https://wallaceecomod.github.io/wallace/articles/tutorial-v2.html and it is also available in Spanish <https://wallaceecomod.github.io/wallace/articles/tutorial-v2-esp.html>.

Also, there is guidance text available for each component and each module within Wallace if you need assistance along the way.

- Bethany Johnson
The Wallace team

